OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fovercast with bands of rain moving
OL,7,Fthrough and becoming more prolonged
OL,8,Fover high ground. The wind will
OL,9,Fgradually increase and become gusty at
OL,10,Ftimes. Minimum Temperature 5C.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FCloudy for most and
OL,13,Fremaining mild with further bands of
OL,14,Frain before turning more unsettled
OL,15,Fwith gusty showers later. Maximum
OL,16,FTemperature 13C.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
